Package: qore-treesitter-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-treesitter-module-doc
Built-Using: ${qore:Built-Using}
Description: incremental syntax parsing and queries for Qore
 Native tree-sitter bindings with parsers for Python, Java, JSON, YAML,
 JavaScript, Kotlin, TypeScript, TSX, SQL, Markdown and Qore. This package
 includes grammar query files and compiler metadata for standalone programs.

Package: qore-treesitter-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-treesitter-module
Description: API reference and tests for Qore's tree-sitter module
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example tests for the
 incremental parsers, syntax trees, cursors, queries and language metadata.
